<title>ICELAND: SOCCER-NORWAY BEAT ICELAND IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NORWAY BEAT ICELAND IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>REYKJAVIK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway beat Iceland 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in a friendly international on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Jostein Flo 74</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,500</p>
</text>
